🌐 Task-2 – Landing Page
CodSoft Web Development Internship | Level 1

📋 Project Overview
This is a Landing Page built using HTML & CSS as part of the CodSoft Level 1 Internship.
It includes sections like 🧭 Navbar, 🌟 Hero, 💡 Features, 🎯 CTA, and 🏁 Footer, focusing on a modern, responsive design.

🛠️ Technologies Used
💻 HTML5
🎨 CSS3

✨ Features
✅ Clean, professional design
📱 Responsive layout for desktop & mobile
🏗️ Structured and beginner-friendly

